  '''
  # Benchmark Report
  
  ## Comparison
  
  | Role | Target | Git | Treatment |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | Baseline | baseline | abc123 | off |
  | Candidate | candidate | abc123 | proofs |
  
  *2 file(s): math.egg, rewrite.egg · 2 round(s) per endpoint/file · 120 s timeout per run · Report: /tmp/benchmark-report.jsonl*
  
  *This comparison changes both target and treatment. Its ratios describe the joint endpoint change and do not isolate one cause.*
  
  ## Summary — candidate proofs vs baseline off
  
  | Metric | Scope | File(s) | Ratio (95% CI) | Result |
  | --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- |
  | Wall time | Suite total | 2 files | 0.983–1.16x | CI includes 1 |
  | Wall time | Lowest-ratio file | math.egg | 0.652–0.978x | faster |
  | Wall time | Highest-ratio file | rewrite.egg | 1.10–1.30x | slower |
  | Peak RSS | Lowest-ratio file | math.egg | 0.867–1.04x | CI includes 1 |
  | Peak RSS | Highest-ratio file | rewrite.egg | 1.08–1.23x | higher RSS |
  
  *Ratios are candidate / baseline; below 1 is lower and above 1 is higher.*
  
  ## Per-file results
  
  ### Wall time
  
  | File | Baseline (95% CI) | Candidate (95% CI) | Ratio (95% CI) | Result |
  | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
  | math.egg | 0.883–1.14 s | 683–937 ms | 0.652–0.978x | faster |
  | rewrite.egg | 1.88–2.14 s | 2.28–2.54 s | 1.10–1.30x | slower |
  
