  ## Slowdown decomposition
  
  | File | Wall Δ | Typecheck | Frontend | Program | Equality | Commands | Residual |
  | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
  | Suite total (2 files) | +200 ms | 0%  0 ms | 0%  0 ms | ◆ +58.0%  +116 ms | 0%  0 ms | 0%  0 ms | +42.0%  +84.0 ms |
